Package: cpxy
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: ip-full, kmod-tun
Conflicts: cpxy-router
Section: net
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: cpxy-ng
Description: cpxy for OpenWrt: per network, an HTTP proxy, LAN routing with split DNS and a Tailscale exit node
 One instance per set of networks, using cpxy or an external SOCKS5 proxy: cpxy-client (HTTP proxy),
 cpxy-router (kernel IPv4/IPv6 split, overseas TCP/DNS through SOCKS5)
 and cpxy-tsgw (Tailscale exit node). Configure /etc/config/cpxy.
